# The brain's attributes file for `hw review` (core/t6_review.go): handed to git as `-c core.attributesFile=<this file>`, so the
# product repo is read and nothing is written in it. The hunk header of `git diff -U0` then names the function a change is in.
# go and python are git's own drivers; `jsfn` is defined on the command line (reviewJSDriver). Shell, SQL and XML functions are
# not extracted: the function table is a quality check, not the boundary.
*.go diff=golang
*.py diff=python
*.js diff=jsfn
*.mjs diff=jsfn
*.cjs diff=jsfn
*.jsx diff=jsfn
*.ts diff=jsfn
*.tsx diff=jsfn
